{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SuperPacker is a game about packing an absurd amount of cardboard boxes. To help you in this endeavour, you will recruit a wide variety of helpful box packers, like double hand, friendly worker, and a cat (though she is not much of a help :P).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pack cardboard boxes and sell them to earn cash</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a lot of QoL upgrades to speed up packing boxes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > cat</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > cloud saving (you are taking your boxes everywhere)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > music and art by my friend Raghav Gohil</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"We Begin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3926560/7d054069afac732564dc2785f9ff2b753b8165fa.jpg"},{"name":"Play the game on Linux","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3926560/8822bd11914980f7a094f00c6e5296751ba9d8c5.jpg"},{"name":"Nice!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3926560/b0b0b3c1583579fe008198e2d86e1e2bca7f3d37.jpg"},{"name":"Two hands are better than one","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3926560/41c7701814a44b6ed3661952459f0795847bfd77.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome to Camp!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3926560/18d48d8cc5fd1213c6c7fb58528a3d123cd98b9c.jpg"},{"name":"Cat-astrophic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3926560/f4aa5b576bc400c74728b8d45dfa96274f1608ab.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3926560?t=1766820464","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images